From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Eicke Hecht <eicke.hecht@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 22:02:45 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 8/8] hw/misc/imx8mp: use the QEMU 10.2 header paths

The Cortex-M7 AMP series is based on QEMU 11.1-dev, after the hw/*.h
headers moved to hw/core/. Point the new i.MX8MP devices back at the
10.2 locations so the series builds on the QEMU that oe-core ships.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [backport of an 11.1-dev series to 10.2]
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
